      "created_at": "2016-02-21T06:20:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I wonder if it's phrased that way so it can be removed from the game (destroyed) without causing the crash. Take it out by a means&nbsp;<em>other than</em> reducing it to zero HP and the game doesn't end? Otherwise, having it come up would be harsher than lost in the past or self-destruct.</p>",
